	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  HP Device Manager :  FATAL:  no pg_hba.conf entry for host "::1", user]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=8451#p8451"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>la ligne de lancement du service : </p><p>C:/Program Files/HP/HP Device Manager/Server/pgsql/bin/pg_ctl.exe runservice -N &quot;HPDM PostgreSQL 8.3&quot; -D &quot;C:/Program Files/HP/HP Device Manager/Server/pgsql/data&quot; -w&#160; -o &quot;-p 40006&quot;</p>]]></content>
